  <entry>
    <title>CF2283C 题解</title>
    <url>/2026/11/05/CF2283C%20%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="题意简述"><a href="#题意简述" class="headerlink" title="题意简述"></a>题意简述</h2><p>从 <code>1</code> 到 <code>n</code> 中选择一些数字，将选中的数字乘 <code>2</code>，使修改后所有数字的异或和不小于原序列按位或的 <code>2</code> 倍。</p>
<blockquote>
<p>tag:计数 动态规划</p>
<p>难度cf1250 洛谷普及</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="思考"><a href="#思考" class="headerlink" title="思考"></a>思考</h2><p>设 <code>n</code> 的最高位下标为 <code>d</code>。因为 <code>1</code> 到 <code>n</code> 中包含 <code>2^d</code>，并且低于第 <code>d</code> 位的每一位都能在某个数中出现，所以：</p>
<p>$$1 \mid 2 \mid \cdots \mid n &#x3D; 2^{d+1}-1 &#x3D; 111\cdots111_2$$</p>
<p>记这个按位或的结果为 <code>k</code>。</p>
<p>因此，我们需要让最终异或和至少为 <code>2k</code>。由于：</p>
<p>$$2k &#x3D; 2^{d+2}-2 &#x3D; 111\cdots110_2$$</p>
<p>所以目标是让最终异或和的第 <code>d+1</code> 位到第 <code>1</code> 位全部为 <code>1</code>，最低位无特殊要求。</p>
<h2 id="贪心"><a href="#贪心" class="headerlink" title="贪心"></a>贪心</h2><p>先计算当前异或和 $ans &#x3D; 1 \oplus 2 \oplus \cdots \oplus n$，然后从高位向低位处理。</p>
<p>假设当前处理第 <code>i+1</code> 位：</p>
<ul>
<li><p>如果这一位已经是 <code>1</code>，不需要操作；</p>
</li>
<li><p>如果这一位是 <code>0</code>，就选择 <code>2^i</code>，将它乘 <code>2</code> 变成 <code>2^{i+1}</code>。</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>这次操作会使异或和变为：</p>
<p>$$ans’ &#x3D; ans \oplus 2^i \oplus 2^{i+1}$$</p>
<p>因此只会改变第 <code>i</code> 位和第 <code>i+1</code> 位。当前第 <code>i+1</code> 位会被翻转为 <code>1</code>，而更高位不会受到影响。</p>
<p>继续从高位处理到低位，就能保证已经处理好的高位不会被破坏，最终得到满足条件的异或和。</p>
<h2 id="复杂度"><a href="#复杂度" class="headerlink" title="复杂度"></a>复杂度</h2><p>计算初始异或和为 <code>O(n)</code>，按位贪心为 <code>O(log n)</code>，总复杂度为 <code>O(n)</code>。</p>
<p>代码</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">#include &lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span><br><span class="line">using namespace std;</span><br><span class="line">typedef long long ll;</span><br><span class="line">typedef __int128 lll;</span><br><span class="line">typedef pair&lt;ll, ll&gt; PLL;</span><br><span class="line">typedef pair&lt;int, int&gt; PII;</span><br><span class="line">typedef tuple&lt;int, int, int&gt; TII;</span><br><span class="line">#define endl &#x27;\n&#x27;</span><br><span class="line">const ll N = 2e5 + 5;</span><br><span class="line">const ll INF = 1e18, MINF = -1e18;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">void solve()</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll n;</span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; n;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll ans = 0;</span><br><span class="line">    vector&lt;ll&gt; aa;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    for (int i = 1; i &lt;= n; i++)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        ans ^= i;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    for (int i = n; i &gt;= 1; i--)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        bool flag = (i &amp; (i - 1)) == 0;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        if (flag)</span><br><span class="line">        &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            if ((ans ^ i ^ (2 * i)) &gt; ans)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                aa.push_back(1);</span><br><span class="line">                ans = ans ^ i ^ (2 * i);</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">            else</span><br><span class="line">            &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                aa.push_back(0);</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        else</span><br><span class="line">        &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            aa.push_back(0);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    reverse(aa.begin(), aa.end());</span><br><span class="line">    for (auto v : aa)</span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cout &lt;&lt; v &lt;&lt; &#x27; &#x27;;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    cout &lt;&lt; endl;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">int main()</span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);</span><br><span class="line">    cin.tie(0);</span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line">    ll t = 1;</span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; t;</span><br><span class="line">    while (t--)</span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        solve();</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    return 0;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
